{
  "schemaVersion": "story-package-beat-module/0.1",
  "package": {
    "id": "taixu-relics-part1",
    "version": "0.1.3"
  },
  "chapter": {
    "id": "chapter-017",
    "title": "顾氏旧印"
  },
  "beat": {
    "id": "beat_chapter_090",
    "nodeId": "node_source_continuity",
    "summary": "顾长离抬头看向黑铁门：“他们把人交给了门。”",
    "narrativeBrief": [
      {
        "text": "青铜门之后没有道路。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-001",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2695,
          "end": 2695
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临跨进去时，脚下先是一空，随后踩在冰冷的石面上。雾气从膝下漫过，顾长离和叶观澜紧跟着进来。黑衣人没有追，他们停在门外，像是知道门内的规则不允许更多人同行。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-002",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2697,
          "end": 2697
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "门在身后合拢。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-003",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2699,
          "end": 2699
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "雾气很快散开，露出一条宽阔的青石街。街两侧立着三层高的石楼，窗户全部封死，楼顶悬着断裂的铜管。铜管中没有水，却不时传出灵力流动的低鸣。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-004",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2701,
          "end": 2701
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“灵脉城。”叶观澜说。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-005",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2703,
          "end": 2703
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“这里还有人住？”陆照临问。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-006",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2705,
          "end": 2705
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“曾经有。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-007",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2707,
          "end": 2707
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "街心立着一座石碑，碑面只写着城名，落款处却被整块削平。顾长离走到碑后，发现一排浅孔，孔距与顾氏账房常用的铜钉一致。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-008",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2709,
          "end": 2709
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“封存工程的标记。”她说。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-009",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2711,
          "end": 2711
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你确定？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-010",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2713,
          "end": 2713
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我小时候见过同样的孔。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-011",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2715,
          "end": 2715
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "叶观澜看她：“顾家告诉过你什么？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-012",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2717,
          "end": 2717
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“他们说祖辈修过一座废城。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-013",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2719,
          "end": 2719
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“只说了修城？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-014",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2721,
          "end": 2721
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“还说城里没有死人。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-015",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2723,
          "end": 2723
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临看向紧闭的石楼。每一扇窗后都垂着黑布，黑布上布满细小的白点，像有人从里面用指甲反复刮过。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-016",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2725,
          "end": 2725
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "街尽头有一座拱门。拱门上方悬着一盏完整的灯，灯芯点燃，火焰却是青色。火光照着门额上的四个字：归墟灵城。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-017",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2727,
          "end": 2727
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“不要看太久。”叶观澜提醒。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-018",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2729,
          "end": 2729
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“看灯会怎样？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-019",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2731,
          "end": 2731
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“会想起你不属于这里的部分。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-020",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2733,
          "end": 2733
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临移开目光，掌心残印仍然发热。青灯下方刻着一行小字：第二枚残印，封于城心。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-021",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2735,
          "end": 2735
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离走近一步：“这行字是新刻的。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-022",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2737,
          "end": 2737
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你怎么看出来？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-023",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2739,
          "end": 2739
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“刀痕没有积灰。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-024",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2741,
          "end": 2741
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "叶观澜没有否认：“有人希望我们来。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-025",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2743,
          "end": 2743
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "城中忽然传来铃声。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-026",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2745,
          "end": 2745
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "不是钟，也不是灯罩碰撞，而是一串细小的铜铃从远处依次响起。街上的石楼同时打开一扇窗，黑布被风卷起，露出一张张苍白的脸。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-027",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2747,
          "end": 2747
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临看见那些脸没有五官。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-028",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2749,
          "end": 2749
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“活人？”顾长离问。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-029",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2751,
          "end": 2751
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“曾经是。”叶观澜说。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-030",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2753,
          "end": 2753
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "无脸的人从窗后伸出手，手腕上都缠着黑色铜丝。他们没有说话，只用指尖敲击窗框。三下之后，街尽头的拱门缓缓打开。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-031",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2755,
          "end": 2755
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "门后出现一名僧人。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-032",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2757,
          "end": 2757
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "僧人穿灰衣，手里捧着一面无相铜镜。镜面没有倒影，只有一层缓慢流动的雾。他向叶观澜点头：“归墟盟的人，也开始带钥匙了。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-033",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2759,
          "end": 2759
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“无相寺的慧闻？”叶观澜问。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-034",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2761,
          "end": 2761
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“名字不重要。”僧人看向陆照临，“重要的是他还能记住多久。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-035",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2763,
          "end": 2763
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临问：“你知道陆沉舟吗？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-036",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2765,
          "end": 2765
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "僧人没有直接回答。他把铜镜转向街边的青灯，镜面立刻浮出一段影像：三年前的归墟灵城还没有封闭，城中站满修士。陆沉舟提着一盏灯，沿街逐一点亮灯柱。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-037",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2767,
          "end": 2767
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "灯柱亮到第七盏时，整座城的影子开始向城心聚拢。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-038",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2769,
          "end": 2769
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆沉舟回头，对身旁两个人说了什么。影像没有声音，却能看出其中一人佩着顾氏铜环，另一人穿着归墟盟旧式青衫。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-039",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2771,
          "end": 2771
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“他们在做什么？”顾长离问。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-040",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2773,
          "end": 2773
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "慧闻收起铜镜：“封存。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-041",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2775,
          "end": 2775
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“封存什么？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-042",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2777,
          "end": 2777
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“一条会自己生长的灵脉。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-043",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2779,
          "end": 2779
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "叶观澜皱眉：“太虚遗脉？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-044",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2781,
          "end": 2781
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你们称它为太虚。”慧闻说，“城里的人称它为回声。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-045",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2783,
          "end": 2783
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "街上的无脸人同时敲了第四下窗框。青灯的火焰向城心倾斜，门内地面裂开一道细缝。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-046",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2785,
          "end": 2785
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临掌心残印骤然发亮。裂缝中浮出一块灰白石片，纹路只完成了一半，缺口与他手中的残印恰好相对。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-047",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2787,
          "end": 2787
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“第二枚残印。”叶观澜伸手。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-048",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2789,
          "end": 2789
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "一次。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-073",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2839,
          "end": 2839
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "叶观澜拔出短刃，割断最近的一根铜丝。无脸人立刻向后仰倒，窗框里溅出一片青白粉末。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-056",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2988,
          "end": 2988
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“不能全断。”慧闻说，“它们会把城心一起拉醒。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-057",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2990,
          "end": 2990
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离把铜片塞进陆照临手里：“带走。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-058",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2992,
          "end": 2992
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你呢？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-059",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2994,
          "end": 2994
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我要找顾氏的名字。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-060",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2996,
          "end": 2996
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“清单上已经被划掉。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-061",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2998,
          "end": 2998
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“划掉不等于不存在。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-062",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3000,
          "end": 3000
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "她转身冲向城心，铜针在指间连成一线。叶观澜拦住她：“城心的灯还没点。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-063",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3002,
          "end": 3002
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“所以才要去。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-064",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3004,
          "end": 3004
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“点灯会让你看见家族真正做过的事。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-065",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3006,
          "end": 3006
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我已经看见他们做过的第一件事。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-066",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3008,
          "end": 3008
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离抬头看向黑铁门：“他们把人交给了门。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-067",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3010,
          "end": 3010
        }
      }
    ],
